{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Made in Hong Kong. By Unreal Engine 5.5.4. Map data from the Land Dept of the government of the HKSAR. (Open3Dhk)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Background:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kwun Tong is a short horror game that take place in an industrial district. People become soulless after economic collapse. Wandering on streets. Looking for money......</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game is about 60mins in length</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Challenging boss fights</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Minimal text and no document to read</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Based on actual geometry</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 1st POV</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Story with several chapters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Linear gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Settings:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports Full Screen / Windowed Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports TSR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Supports HDR</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- No save feature. You can access different chapters freely from main menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By Unreal Engine 5.5.4.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>\u4e00\u5ea7\u88ab\u5d29\u6f70\u56f0\u64fe\u7684\u57ce\u5e02</u></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u89c0\u5858 | Kwun Tong \u662f\u4e00\u6b3e\u77ed\u5c0f\u7684\u9ad8\u7aef\u6c1b\u570d\u6050\u6016-\u5192\u96aa\u904a\u6232\uff0c\u8a2d\u5b9a\u5728\u5f8c\u5d29\u6f70\u7684\u9999\u6e2f\uff0c\u8ff7\u832b\u7684\u5e02\u6c11\u70ba\u4e86\u9322\u800c\u5f98\u5f8a\u30